    "description": "Townhouse, level 3 of 3: L2 plus flourish 3. Over budget: 355 blocks vs 265 (first build 267 vs 205). Narrow two-storey town house: stone ground floor (kitchen-living room with hearth, table, stores under the stairs), plaster and dark oak upper storey jettied over the street on brackets, 3 beds upstairs by a staircase; L2 shutters, planters, lanterns and a log pile, L3 a back garden, jetty flower boxes, chimney smoke and a lantern post. Not yet builder-tested: allium, azure_bluet, brick_stairs, candle, cornflower, fern, oxeye_daisy, red_tulip, red_wall_banner, spruce_fence_gate, vine. Decoration step adds: banner_pattern.",
